/P 65 0 R
/E (Tee is a UCS-dedicated and experienced QHSE Manager, committed to upholding the highest standards across the company. With close to 15 years of service, Tee brings deep institutional knowledge and a steady hand to every project. Tee leads the charge in fostering a culture of safety, continuous improvement, and accountability, working closely with all departments to ensure everyone goes home safe, every day. His efforts are key to maintaining compliance, reducing risk, and empowering teams with the tools and training they need to succeed.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [32]
>>
endobj
254 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (TQHSE plays a vital role in making the company a safer, more efficient, and more responsible place to work. From developing safety protocols and conducting audits to leading environmental initiatives and quality control processes, Tee is proud to stand behind the scenes of every safe operation and successful outcome. His mission is not just about meeting standards, it's about raising them. By continually improving our systems and supporting the wellbeing of every employee, he will help shape a workplace where safety and excellence are at the heart of everything we do.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [33]
>>
